r-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138739","source_hash":"cb8c6b238f800814355e19339cd8accac66e3694f0770d65b3b95a72a190e49c","text":"备注"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00038","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138740","source_hash":"33474ba5b952104f04fb5e6ef042c4adc118094404ed998b78d75c61f35ee36e","text":"尽管有上表所示，但在人口超过100万的城市中，消防队长的级别是"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00039","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138741","source_hash":"16ac444064eda89cdb317fa1b69d5eeafa4c5bca842cddb2313f42457c0f0203","text":"这可能由消防总监执行。在这种情况下，如果相关城市设立了两个或两个以上的消防站……"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00040","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138742","source_hash":"66109f7c2b6f6663fb4f332bf61e44daf0636c77b4c2317621cae03feb1123b5","text":"在上述例子中，其中一个消防站站长的军衔可以设定为消防准将。"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00041","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138743","source_hash":"581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147","text":"."},{"id":"A29437-zh-00042","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138744","source_hash":"1c7188dbc4adf8cea8eb465371242cc86177243d6aec0099a699b2ce398b5413","text":"2. 尽管有上表，119安全中心负责人的军衔也可能是消防队长。在这种情况下，"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00043","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138745","source_hash":"0471583a5d878f7c1b635987c8883fec9fd4c2e7ea9f4b2cf968a3641d6df83f","text":"针对这119个安全中心，其遴选标准是履行消防职责所必需的。"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00044","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138746","source_hash":"d18f041d72c647110680974ea246639eecc670572e3b68b29329c2ca94718b66","text":"由国家消防局局长根据人员和设备情况或火灾、救援和紧急医疗调度频率确定"},{"id":"A29437-zh-00045","doc":"A29437","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138747","source_hash":"581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147","text":"."},{"id":"A29438-zh-00001","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138748","source_hash":"9387c8ee8e11a596273b18d99f0dc2c44a29f33f8e50fc17a7d205a7ab198069","text":"■ 地方消防机构设立条例 [附录2] <2026年6月23日修订>"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00002","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138749","source_hash":"b4901b52ce07e95552dffafd177b95c827c65fc0d965fd4e373994bf17cd5081","text":"消防站、119分局、119安全中心等的安装标准"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00003","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138750","source_hash":"31f1e861e209f8c91b861168dfe03996ca2b3caec4af025c181bfd10fc0d399f","text":"（与第五条第三款和第八条第三款有关）"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00004","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138751","source_hash":"fe90733f84263acc4891c8c91435b0552015ed7b5f186b56b655ac057549e521","text":"1. 消防站安装标准"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00005","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138752","source_hash":"6d7fb3d4948f89f4f3dfb184ac42e2835af9db09002d0e345efef0bd719763b3","text":"a. 城市（《济州特别自治道设立及国际自由城市设立特别法》第十五条）"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00006","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138753","source_hash":"b53748897bb1e2ee72e2ab916fb383dcee1976899068723f8afee841cfa5755a","text":"包括第2款规定的行政城市（下文亦适用）· 县· 区（地方政府）"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00007","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138754","source_hash":"344e8c2cb03911b31f3030dbfc465d46f59716bf764316f9aa29218c0e4901a8","text":"指的是（下文同样适用），安装在设备上，前提是为有效执行消防任务，"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00008","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138755","source_hash":"67311bbf94d5d340351aa6fdc2ff44ee6ac915ab2df77c9289fb90b483936757","text":"特别是，如有必要，可以将其安装在包括邻近城市、县和区在内的区域单元中。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00009","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138756","source_hash":"86a1c2a464c15dedd6731c95a7bd21a6d5137bd9c5c92d2d973627070388368a","text":"有。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00010","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138757","source_hash":"cec788a50923f7db8a05eb27c83231b12d5f3866676cd5a3df3488b9c5bbe650","text":"b. 根据第a款设立的消防站管辖区域内，已安装119个安全中心，数量为5个。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00011","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138758","source_hash":"9cf6690dfc9a9df621652a6c1932a7b9998437e1acdb99c7568f6d3acb04a26d","text":"，则可能需要增设消防站。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00012","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138759","source_hash":"c8b2573ac4c2638cbed975245cead0b83c9a3db85e7be1e063888950cd270256","text":"尽管有第 (a) 和 (b) 款的规定，石油化工综合体、工业综合体、住宅综合体或文化"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00013","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138760","source_hash":"00e3b47ceea50aa2b8a3809b51cc8a9bf8f91a539bacc839627da3cf388218d7","text":"由于旅游综合体等的发展，存在发生大规模火灾或消防需求激增的风险。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00014","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138761","source_hash":"630d38fa07c9adb044292b504079dfb709e3df40896279a04bdc0c502659ebba","text":"如有需要采取特殊消防措施的情况，可在每个相关区域设立消防站。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00015","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138762","source_hash":"581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147","text":"."},{"id":"A29438-zh-00016","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138763","source_hash":"e98e5666aef352dc0aabeebdfcb759182423b554efec9d97e258c010f19d973b","text":"2. 119 个分支机构的安装标准"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00017","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138764","source_hash":"5212fd56eed2b305fcd3ff56b1e81ca539267845dab8487c0c6f2ee77c598cfb","text":"a. 在没有消防站的城市、县和地区，可以设立 119 个分支机构。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00018","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138765","source_hash":"415d3487a2689d2aee4760412de5602115dbf56fae5e147732e92938bfb7b6b9","text":"b. 根据第1项b款或c款，或第a款，可以设立消防站的区域"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00019","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138766","source_hash":"bc992a638110a6b981aa5fb8a238354f23a41bd65c0248c3a48d06c3778f6c10","text":"尽管该地区已经设立了119个门诊站，但石化联合企业和工业园区"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00020","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138767","source_hash":"b21b814daaa90094d0d7746a8d0afb461e821d2ec4bdaecebbdbafa7eef9d9c6","text":"如果由于住宅区或文化旅游综合体等的开发而存在发生大规模火灾的风险。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00021","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138768","source_hash":"1da3cdec1220f9e469b62766726f9660f6274f1be3ce3f8705bfd9c1f8028e37","text":"在消防需求激增且需要采取特殊消防措施的地区，设有119个前哨站。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00022","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138769","source_hash":"350c6993d1428f42b9eb6f2329aecf245566820904165efd1f341dab5644733c","text":"可额外安装。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00023","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138770","source_hash":"be6fd2efa38e49ebfd203f2028450ed230fd80f8599dc81ef768a6bd1bdc8592","text":