不足 10 万的城市和县：人口在 1.5 万以上或面积"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00032","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138779","source_hash":"4dc1e4fdc0e908f6b2428c75582c0c29104b917018dcd13534b0707a707b7a9e","text":"15㎢或更多"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00033","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138780","source_hash":"789c5e21015049a6e27d812b4f13e5b2da5e9f95ab65a56a2218b7a6db3983dc","text":"5) 人口少于50,000的地区：人口10,000或以上或面积20平方公里或以上"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00034","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138781","source_hash":"be1d90223ea4f7d40d4d0942fc95b43c99ecaf2f48aad09fb2bbc6c2ed76665b","text":"b. 尽管有第a款的规定，石化综合体、工业综合体、住宅综合体或文化旅游综合体"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00035","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138782","source_hash":"d2879722673d4a436b9ac52963b0d754321c6ada991bc07de50a74bbdd1937dc","text":"由于[]等的发展，存在发生大规模火灾或消防需求激增的风险，因此[特殊]"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00036","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138783","source_hash":"ce47f91e64e1e4686b9521464fba5da9b65957da4f771aa5d8b274c556cb0c7f","text":"如果需要采取消防措施，可以在每个相关区域设立 119 个安全中心。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00037","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138784","source_hash":"9480773fd3d5f78b1fd7ca4341e02a46ea0251ce5288dbccba225d60145f3c90","text":"4. 消防艇单元安装标准"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00038","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138785","source_hash":"35c497b918975e8287b10f6210b07b33fe0016cce829b810b325f0dc2d5d63db","text":"a. 根据《港口法》第二条第一款，在对港口具有管辖权的消防站设立消防船队。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00039","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138786","source_hash":"c36b37e3f8e748b8caf89fb57e8570d6ec045262f3bae20d4a0cbb82d75c5b4a","text":"可以执行。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00040","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138787","source_hash":"053a17c8b1b09ccdaad851539f29b43f2abe6d430b4f6d3d92d7594d9234628e","text":"B. 尽管有A款的规定，港口流动人口和物流的快速增长导致了大规模的"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00041","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138788","source_hash":"2948be278cc8f22f4a9405d34488e36ec74aab7e6b3d49f038fd04574c99ed5e","text":"在存在火灾风险或需要采取特殊消防措施的情况下，应在相关区域进行消防。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00042","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138789","source_hash":"49fd4684512caa5c0ca6875a84e1ba0437bc7b91ee11c87800ee161eb8663747","text":"可以安装直杆。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00043","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138790","source_hash":"c96fcdcaff6d62297928f2036bbf0e74e8a2347021b4cdcee654e6e036030e4e","text":"5. 119 个区域消防站的安装标准"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00044","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138791","source_hash":"62fa8cc1e53f15159f6cee445c4053c034582fe1771c58bcc79db82df5a5297a","text":"a. 位于邑市和面市，未设立119紧急求助中心，且管辖面积超过30平方公里的地区"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00045","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138792","source_hash":"5c84ce4b5ce06a53d499e2d66910703e1c0f6e5696e54fc25a67058bc11251ca","text":"它可以安装在人口超过3000的地区。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00046","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138793","source_hash":"9d112f5ac75ae682e1d00f65c5b4354bdf4d38d59b8068dbc1b87e60c0606a28","text":"b. 作为农业和工业综合体、住宅综合体或文化和旅游综合体等开发区域，相邻的消防站或"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00047","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138794","source_hash":"c092a0398b82cdb4b0978a80557914237e2f53525904a7e8659d88be1f683802","text":"它可以安装在距离 119 安全中心 10 公里以上的区域。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00048","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138795","source_hash":"a49662227d8e12a0852a314d9dda9b5977eb1f6a690bcac5c6f4b88fce9a18e5","text":"隶属于岛屿和山区119安全中心的消防员迅速出动。"},{"id":"A29438-zh-00049","doc":"A29438","law_id":"kr-003971-287385-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2138796","source_hash":"4bc1b49fbad82ce0fd145e630b65187696c683e5006a6b4300d3534042796431","text":"它可以安装在难以安装的区域。"}]}